4dd85f5f-5c5c-475b-bd88-ecf9cf02a2c2	2026-06-01 08:14:08+00	git	backend: real predictive ML model (from-scratch logistic regression)	- ml/logreg.py: logistic regression by gradient descent (standardisation,\n  L2, class weighting) + accuracy/precision/recall/AUC. Verified on synthetic\n  data (recovers true weights, AUC 0.92).\n- ml/features.py: leakage-free daily features (dow, recency, streak, rolling\n  activity). Dropped absolute time-index (leaks under time-split).\n- scripts/train_predictor.py: ingest git -> daily timeline -> time-based\n  train/test split -> fit -> evaluate -> save weights -> forecast tomorrow.\n- Honest data-sufficiency guard: with only ~11 active days the model flags\n  itself untrustworthy (overfits). Real fix is more signal sources.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.8	[-0.13595095,-0.07556763,-0.05186264,0.10155595,0.079816766,-0.084503345,-0.03499612,0.06153242,-0.14515659,0.009282969,0.0040754885,0.0041925944,-0.026695369,-0.0071888147,-0.009643176,-0.018467674,-0.011838084,0.014794922,-0.02861108,-0.0437813,-0.022152478,0.005332306,0.009204061,0.1020914,-0.008590564,-0.06454691,0.002488904,0.018005777,-0.0645962,-0.11770982,-0.026709424,0.024876282,-0.004470746,-0.031606972,-0.03115784,0.09425222,-0.0047215777,-0.06866224,-0.025069747,-0.027363086,0.022640372,-0.10424066,-0.01616278,-0.0011849153,0.022573102,-0.008805721,0.028239977,-0.045160893,0.023807866,-0.0020801197,-0.09945564,-0.0057234694,0.0071627065,0.03469833,-0.09858542,-0.0034983207,0.0046845125,-0.023760771,-0.0026520584,-0.06984103,0.00374297,0.059045564,-0.093497664,0.015323691,-0.003858186,-0.00086759246,-0.059361592,0.080326304,0.14301158,0.02510241,-0.009144181,-0.017373007,-0.116362,-0.021649545,0.049006965,0.018781096,0.037529055,-0.038834006,0.024640424,-0.0038647682,-0.03631411,0.028650163,-0.011784062,-0.018073488,0.052066386,-0.026160369,0.07551455,0.08770247,0.03543019,-0.005850506,0.06685973,0.0010573923,0.031101396