4fd6f374-8b4d-423f-a3aa-f1d0fea50586	2026-05-27 18:01:05+00	git	Initial commit: Synthetic Genesis core simulation engine	Complete architecture and working simulation with:\n- NumPy SoA Entity-Component-System (16K entity capacity)\n- 64-gene genome with two-point crossover and Gaussian mutation\n- 8-axis emotion model, 6-axis Maslow needs, 16-axis philosophical beliefs\n- Weighted action selection via softmax (8 actions: forage/flee/social/explore/rest/reproduce/learn/build)\n- Procedural Perlin noise world with 8 biomes, 7 resource types, seasonal climate\n- 15 ECS systems running at variable frequencies (physics, metabolism, cognition, emotion, social, reproduction, belief formation, communication, conflict, etc.)\n- Spatial hash grid for O(1) neighbor queries\n- FastAPI server with REST endpoints and WebSocket real-time broadcasting\n- Deterministic seeded RNG (same seed = same universe)\n- SQLite persistence layer with compressed NumPy snapshots\n- Relationship graph, memory system, knowledge bitmask\n- History system with event log, chronicles, memory mutation, oral tradition pipeline\n\nBenchmarks: 1575 TPS with 500 entities, self-sustaining population with 105+ generations of evolution per simulated year.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.5	[-0.035854634,-0.056288894,-0.041753676,0.0044211587,0.019868271,-0.058812432,-0.109952934,-0.015705489,0.0024724419,0.052235052,-0.04138185,-0.09695784,-0.013116479,-0.045586307,0.012016225,-0.023755835,0.023652997,-0.036209784,-0.011814926,-0.050498404,-0.02664951,-0.009050452,0.0069331285,-0.0046747443,-0.0025455437,-0.0055633155,-0.0067521003,0.039694414,0.024348294,-0.0848454,0.04455312,0.004218124,0.057776365,0.04132749,-0.03342821,0.09146283,-0.005106525,-0.102933004,-0.032278974,0.027071126,-0.0007932795,-0.021166949,-0.052186243,-0.012365473,0.07499744,0.017628232,-0.05364896,-0.008786813,-0.0057601677,-0.032854903,-0.10762622,-0.051863667,-0.00044947397,0.08730602,0.045