5af4795d-613a-46b8-834b-64972a68daae	2026-05-30 00:14:37+00	git	Add Red Team — standalone synthetic fraud simulation platform	Introduce red_team/, a self-contained adversarial fraud research\nenvironment for generating synthetic fraud scenarios, datasets, and\nanalytics. Completely isolated from the Blue Team: no shared models,\ndatabases, APIs, datasets, or feedback loops.\n\nComponents:\n- core: pydantic models, config, and enforced isolation/provenance safety\n- synthetic_data: fictional identity + transaction-graph generators (faker)\n- simulators: scenario-spec -> labelled dataset engine (seed-deterministic)\n- scenario_library: 8 beginner/intermediate/advanced scenarios\n- adversarial_research: parameter-space realism/diversity exploration\n- evolution_engine: GA loop improving scenario realism (Red-Team-internal fitness)\n- analytics: aggregate metrics + dashboard reports\n- datasets: CSV/JSON/graph/report exporter\n- documentation: architecture, methodology, ethics & safety, roadmap\n- cli: list-scenarios / generate / explore / evolve / report\n\nAll artefacts carry a synthetic watermark; assert_isolation() runs at\nimport and CLI start. Verified end-to-end against backend/.venv.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.7000000000000001	[-0.13733335,-0.065701574,-0.1035812,0.015110905,0.08902792,-0.082546055,-0.06748994,0.010662354,-0.058450457,-0.009227936,-0.0061639687,-0.103326544,0.09022284,0.0050069187,0.0030283341,0.008574499,0.0071749925,-0.0035052558,-0.0076794242,-0.049102522,-0.021697475,-0.028264934,-0.0038900843,0.0435535,-0.037875243,-0.015495898,0.014332361,0.026989385,-0.093659796,-0.10746243,0.037632428,0.036433846,0.007997444,-0.020334873,0.054685082,0.10098524,-0.008403689,-0.047229845,-0.014848616,-0.00602845,-0.009874917,-0.0610755,-0.06485104,-0.0072331526,0.08210509,-0.03132127,-0.031770736,0.008866933,0.026614426,-0.013362399,-0.11069457,-0.05430019,-0.0027706493,0.041166145,0.03471272,-0.017499069,