88c8eb0f-f4b3-4aaf-a937-99f9383c4909	2026-05-27 18:09:45+00	git	Add Big Bang cosmic timeline and deep emotional system	Universe now starts from absolute nothing and evolves through 10 cosmic\nepochs: Void -> Big Bang -> Cosmic Formation -> Planetary Formation ->\nPrimordial World -> Chemical Evolution -> Abiogenesis -> Primitive Life ->\nComplex Life -> Sentient Emergence. Life potential accumulates in habitable\nregions based on fertility/moisture/temperature until abiogenesis triggers\nnaturally. Sentient beings only spawn once complexity reaches 1.0.\n\nEnhanced emotional system with three layers:\n- 8 primary emotions (joy, fear, anger, disgust, surprise, trust, sadness, curiosity)\n- 12 complex/composite emotions (love, grief, hope, despair, awe, wonder,\n  loneliness, jealousy, guilt, pride, nostalgia, existential dread)\n- 4-axis mood system (wellbeing, anxiety, contentment, melancholy)\n- Trauma system with 4 scar slots per entity that trigger on matching emotions\n- Emotional contagion spreading feelings through nearby entities\n- Death witnesses gain sadness/fear and can develop trauma from loss\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.7000000000000001	[-0.007820892,-0.033737343,0.026078826,0.095528044,0.0468651,0.012847645,-0.051501542,0.07047366,0.10926899,0.0153676355,0.004671386,-0.12056732,-0.01308839,-0.043043666,0.052126322,0.027632128,-0.019598674,-0.05927955,-0.04985373,0.04062598,-0.005892972,0.03116525,-0.06585511,-0.018805116,-0.04622614,-0.007294162,0.004675591,0.0061189453,0.052078787,-0.06201318,0.05860071,0.027894206,0.117308795,-0.030818759,0.036418304,0.07955574,0.0039529027,-0.012907467,-0.032149278,-0.017986475,-0.031265203,0.026052022,0.01612565,0.015891528,-0.0040698377,-0.057330348,-0.039376874,-0.054997835,-0.0027873986,-0.09547795,-0.07626869,0.0046218564,-0.01819774,0.12132651,0.06995459,-0.024376657,-0.027834509,0.003801412,-0.05196788,-0.06769046,-0.007844506,0.013288055,0.047794104,-0.041885