b6b1e374-1594-4cf1-bf78-cd369f05d9ef	2026-05-19 11:33:29+00	git	feat: initial release — Transaction Graph Intelligence Engine v2.0	Real-time financial fraud detection using graph-based AI.\n\n- FastAPI backend with NetworkX graph engine (BFS, DFS, cycle detection, communities)\n- Isolation Forest + SHAP explainability for anomaly scoring\n- Streaming processor with sliding window velocity analysis\n- Blue Team multi-component fraud verdict engine\n- Forensic evidence generation (JSON + PDF) with YES/NO UX flow\n- React + Three.js 3D live graph visualization\n- WebSocket real-time graph broadcast with step-by-step simulation\n- 6 pre-built fraud scenarios: circular, fan-out, mule chain, layering, structuring, cash mixing\n- Production deployment configs: render.yaml + vercel.json\n- GitHub Actions CI for backend (Python) + frontend (TypeScript build)\n\nFraud patterns: circular_transfer, fan_out, mule_chain, layering, structuring, cash_structuring\nStack: Python · FastAPI · NetworkX · scikit-learn · SHAP · React · Three.js · Cytoscape.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.7000000000000001	[-0.13180628,-0.010666877,-0.058714177,-0.032635003,0.06967433,-0.112679064,-0.0038998276,-0.0033557422,-0.0068333107,0.014171034,0.01281189,-0.036092903,0.043314856,0.015777022,0.020631379,-0.049505685,0.047012813,-0.013325517,0.012467417,-0.0769439,0.0038489487,-0.07114766,-0.015285837,-0.027034909,0.05388016,-0.0050755315,0.016040321,0.02114262,-0.030923957,-0.08546769,0.041130695,0.021219345,-0.024582306,-0.021730248,-0.026635386,-0.0069348007,-0.006827362,-0.034973063,-0.0007721639,0.034293294,0.052631818,-0.026422286,-0.007951496,-0.0153674595,0.013109889,-0.03990012,-0.08872012,0.04142522,0.04175929,0.014494553,-0.12415111,-0.07102415,0.033646606,0.044937536,0.03594377,-0.008695061,0.013273317,-0.029702678,0.0111179715,-0.02335657,0.11564685,-0.00014275,0.08207253,-0.008146955,0.01426585,0.04929776,-0.060704235,0.064180925,0.070132