e341e29e-29f4-49a3-b7c1-fc89830c6390	2026-05-31 18:33:43+00	git	feat(ml): add real XGBoost supervised fraud classifier	Implements a genuine gradient-boosted fraud classifier rather than a\ndocumentation-only claim:\n\n- backend/ml/xgboost_classifier.py: XGBClassifier (200 trees, depth 4)\n  over the shared 12-feature FeatureExtractor vector; trained at start-up\n  on a deterministic synthetic labelled set with realistic overlap +\n  label noise (holdout AUC ~0.93). Graceful fallback if xgboost / its\n  native OpenMP runtime is unavailable.\n- Wire into app lifespan + expose via GET /api/stats (same tier as the\n  Isolation Forest), exported from ml package.\n- requirements: add xgboost==2.0.3 and the previously-missing shap==0.45.1\n  (shap was imported in code + CI but absent from requirements — this was\n  the cause of the failing CI badge).\n- CI: also run on production branch; add xgboost to import check + a step\n  that trains/predicts the classifier.\n- Docs: add XGBoost badge + tech-stack/structure entries to README;\n  update Blue Team ML section to document the supervised model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.7000000000000001	[-0.08627197,-0.072924435,-0.025107786,0.022138637,0.12856504,0.0026579283,0.028120361,-0.002193984,-0.13722554,-0.081649505,0.028242389,-0.118879355,0.08057986,-0.085008524,0.0059651006,0.04748887,0.04738994,-0.007840714,-0.031456027,-0.03401333,-0.009675603,-0.015387382,-0.0057328404,0.04299476,-0.030743381,-0.043287188,-0.046963945,-0.028300151,0.014902198,-0.00681738,0.03271793,0.009961834,0.027184369,-0.0076717203,-0.036632534,-5.2590414e-05,0.014923229,-0.0717253,-0.07297198,-0.031067973,0.02879321,-0.050372414,-0.0524763,-0.043532785,0.07249038,0.0019641593,0.023713214,-0.00911709,-0.019875683,-0.05235666,-0.0017047034,-0.03522305,0.0051135034,0.043787744,0.033208694,-0.002516639,0.03486422,-0.045270517,-0.020346005,-0.016933123,0.04284333,0.01646717,0.044209257,-0.010234367,-0.0109