f80ba2b8-eb40-4a99-ba7b-1903547dee63	2026-05-28 05:21:03+00	git	Wire civilization layer into the simulation engine	Fill out settlement detection, culture evolution, religion clustering,\nlanguage drift, and tech discovery, and connect them to the tick loop\nvia a new CivilizationLayer orchestrator. Settlements form, fragment,\ncollapse to ruins, host emergent religions with schisms, and accumulate\nknown concepts that propagate to their members. Exposes /api/civilization/overview\nand broadcasts settlement/religion/language counters over WebSocket.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.5	[-0.013150547,-0.0102185225,-0.030493129,0.01208144,-0.033837344,-0.009198066,-0.020202331,-0.09667519,0.0373803,0.004025603,-0.033034906,-0.12993824,-0.011672272,-0.04181915,-0.019749366,-0.039713893,-0.02907733,-0.005917833,0.10975621,-0.16107745,-0.056166936,-0.02170035,-0.019905472,-0.021235436,0.07930862,-7.323936e-06,0.02928103,-0.025762534,0.08977251,0.050220504,0.008946324,0.046391353,-0.008005917,0.030493662,-0.06652043,0.06817711,0.023077931,-0.035948463,-0.05208828,0.04285828,0.07519292,0.005964691,0.003732806,-0.0815993,-0.004722457,-0.00578076,-0.075438604,0.005769285,-0.096988015,0.013918289,-0.031800706,-0.04290329,0.05825423,0.06764704,0.024086237,-0.07167266,0.042047054,0.03815185,-0.02759837,-0.0039081983,0.07775064,-0.005119676,0.03170296,0.014692716,0.026247054,0.04396642,0.0013951365,0.16889645,0.03191831,-0.08807976,-0.022501295,0.023731938,0.019150415,0.022993006,0.040243845,-0.031763222,-0.0726346,-0.106463514,0.010661236,-0.10351599,0.01630054,0.028966382,0.013230932,-0.068050094,-0.017516566,0.03146115,-0.026038004,0.06612578,0.06329188,-0.0016700946,-0.04997087,0.0070638005,0.011770319,0.04006002,0.0406503,0.06334292,-0.030216593,-0.027999947,0.029495474,0.061408874,-0.03729827,-0.016310176,0.030641709,-0.060344297,-0.026294617,-0.040889803,-0.081462435,0.03180363,-0.020187115,-0.03367836,-0.06500326,0.014980146,-0.0