f91f37e9-d93b-41bf-9076-0b312d9cc3b9	2026-06-01 07:30:31+00	git	backend: add L4 Pattern Discovery Engine	Builds a daily behavioural feature frame (activity, productivity, learning,\nbuilding, reading, social, late-night, new-skills) and searches it for:\n- contemporaneous correlations between feature pairs (Pearson)\n- time-lagged (lag-1) correlations — "after X comes Y"\n- peak productivity window (best 4h block)\nPure-Python stats, confidence from t-statistic, evidence + sample size on\nevery pattern; constant/low-variance features skipped, nothing emitted below\nthreshold (no fabricated correlations). GET /cognitive/patterns\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>	episodic	null	\N	0.7000000000000001	[-0.004136601,-0.057710543,-0.018894702,0.012652674,0.022909308,0.01806368,-0.037872203,-0.04270866,-0.06493723,-0.008885333,0.015024953,0.023826675,-0.06879156,0.04366684,0.04607717,0.03181306,-0.002788481,-0.022715984,-0.0019673787,-0.11651362,0.017242568,-0.033587255,0.004583773,0.0053774575,0.029046271,0.04713063,-0.016061855,-0.10447524,0.08348264,0.024250237,0.030894145,0.12413,0.05723547,-0.039957292,0.0031139858,-0.037563514,0.10459629,0.019281706,0.023688113,0.061973896,0.002700399,-0.059474222,0.029454801,0.019825462,-0.013223969,0.03295675,-0.00935579,-0.067802586,0.0037902482,-0.048728712,-0.073706165,-0.011034719,0.008789491,-0.004640963,0.01846024,0.013032165,0.020921905,0.054272987,0.0612069,0.0028940844,0.068392515,-0.037896596,-0.056360435,0.04893405,-0.0052294023,0.10039193,-0.045267746,0.067250274,0.06337162,-0.039166253,-0.118879154,0.011769906,-0.032633092,0.010561341,0.07897911,0.021047289,-0.032163173,-0.09193119,0.021549806,-0.062214818,-0.028565533,0.066069126,-0.03322235,-0.012068734,0.0565063,-0.026671339,0.0031670837,0.027599588,-0.003920689,0.0072963336,-0.004961746,-0.044733547,-0.10648133,-0.073032156,-0.11072996,0.09996447,-0.031448565,-0.071922444,0.034241635,0.028958209,-0.015851943,0.033133723,-0.03702106,0.0031377